For origin_availability_alpha:
- Need candidate_prepared (goal). Currently not prepared. Need to prepare it. There is action confirm_candidate_preparedness which requires candidate_created, vehicle_allocated, candidate_task_profile_linked, not candidate_prepared. For origin_availability_alpha, we have candidate_created true, vehicle_allocated true (vehicle_unit_alpha), but we need candidate_task_profile_linked (need to attach task profile). Also need route_task_profile_available (we have). So we can attach_task_profile to origin_availability_alpha, then confirm_candidate_preparedness.

