Also need origin_availability_confirmed and locked, destination_availability_confirmed and locked.

To lock: lock_origin_availability requires candidate_prepared, candidate_operator_linked, origin_availability_node_linked, origin_node_ready, not origin_availability_locked.

We need operator link: assign_operator_resource requires candidate_prepared, operator_available. So after preparing, we assign operator.

