Now we need to ensure transport leg assembled and loading authorized before we can mark dispatch ready. The leg assembly requires origin and destination availabilities locked and confirmed, origin_node_ready, destination_node_ready, transport_leg_available. So we need to have both availabilities locked and confirmed before assembling leg. However loading/unloading steps affect lock status? Load_origin_payload sets origin_availability_locked true (and does not affect confirmed). Unload_origin_payload sets origin_availability_confirmed true but does not change lock (lock remains true). So after load then unload, we have origin locked and confirmed. Good.

