We'll start with origin_availability_alpha preparation.

Step 1: attach_task_profile for origin_availability_alpha.
Precondition: candidate_created origin_availability_alpha (true), vehicle_allocated origin_availability_alpha (true), route_task_profile_available route_task_profile_alpha (true).
Effect: candidate_task_profile_linked origin_availability_alpha route_task_profile_alpha true; route_task_profile_available becomes false.

Step 2: confirm_candidate_preparedness for origin_availability_alpha.
Precondition: candidate_created origin_availability_alpha (true), vehicle_allocated origin_availability_alpha (true), candidate_task_profile_linked origin_availability_alpha route_task_profile_alpha (now true), not candidate_prepared origin_availability_alpha (currently false).
Effect: candidate_prepared origin_availability_alpha true.

Step 3: assign_operator_resource to origin_availability_alpha.
Precondition: candidate_prepared origin_availability_alpha (now true), operator_available driver_operator_alpha (true).
Effect: candidate_operator_linked origin_availability_alpha driver_operator_alpha true; operator_available becomes false.

Step 4: activate_origin_node for origin_availability_alpha.
Precondition: candidate_prepared origin_availability_alpha (true), candidate_task_profile_linked origin_availability_alpha route_task_profile_alpha (true), origin_availability_node_linked origin_availability_alpha origin_node_alpha (true), not origin_node_ready origin_node_alpha (currently false), not origin_node_occupied origin_node_alpha (currently false).
Effect: origin_node_ready origin_node_alpha true.

Step 5: load_origin_payload for origin_availability_alpha.
Precondition: candidate_prepared origin_availability_alpha (true), origin_availability_node_linked origin_availability_alpha origin_node_alpha (true), cargo_available cargo_payload_alpha (true), not origin_availability_locked origin_availability_alpha (currently false).
Effect: origin_node_occupied origin_node_alpha true, origin_availability_locked origin_availability_alpha true, origin_payload_linked origin_availability_alpha cargo_payload_alpha true, not cargo_available cargo_payload_alpha (cargo becomes unavailable).

Step 6: unload_origin_payload for origin_availability_alpha.
Precondition: candidate_prepared origin_availability_alpha (true), candidate_task_profile_linked origin_availability_alpha route_task_profile_alpha (true), origin_availability_node_linked origin_availability_alpha origin_node_alpha (true), origin_node_occupied origin_node_alpha (true), origin_payload_linked origin_availability_alpha cargo_payload_alpha (true), not origin_availability_confirmed origin_availability_alpha (currently false).
Effect: origin_node_ready origin_node_alpha true (already true), origin_availability_confirmed origin_availability_alpha true, cargo_available cargo_payload_alpha true (cargo becomes available again), not origin_payload_linked origin_availability_alpha cargo_payload_alpha (removes link).

Now after these, origin_availability_alpha: prepared true, task profile linked, operator linked, node ready, node occupied, availability locked true, confirmed true, cargo available again.

Now we need to release operator from origin_availability_alpha to make operator available for destination.

Step 7: release_operator_resource for origin_availability_alpha.
Precondition: candidate_operator_linked origin_availability_alpha driver_operator_alpha (true).
Effect: operator_available driver_operator_alpha true, not candidate_operator_linked origin_availability_alpha driver_operator_alpha.

Now we have operator available again.

Now process destination_availability_alpha similarly.

Step 8: attach_task_profile for destination_availability_alpha.
Precondition: candidate_created destination_availability_alpha (true), vehicle_allocated destination_availability_alpha? Currently false (no vehicle allocated yet). Wait attach_task_profile requires vehicle_allocated ?candidate. So we need to allocate vehicle to destination before attaching task profile? Actually attach_task_profile precondition includes vehicle_allocated ?candidate. So we need to allocate vehicle first. However we also need vehicle_allocated destination_availability_alpha vehicle_unit_beta (goal). So we should allocate vehicle before attach_task_profile.

