Step 8a: allocate_vehicle_unit for destination_availability_alpha.
Precondition: candidate_created destination_availability_alpha (true), not vehicle_allocated destination_availability_alpha (true), vehicle_available vehicle_unit_beta (currently true).
Effect: vehicle_allocated destination_availability_alpha true, candidate_vehicle_linked destination_availability_alpha vehicle_unit_beta true, not vehicle_available vehicle_unit_beta (vehicle becomes unavailable).

