))

Yes includes both candidate_task_profile_linked for dest and origin. So we need to satisfy both.

Maybe there is a way to have multiple links without consuming availability because the predicate route_task_profile_available is just a marker but can be re-made true via some action not requiring detach? There's no action to make it available except detach_task_profile. So we need to detach from one after linking the other, but goal requires both linked. So impossible unless we can have two different route_task_profile instances; but only one defined.

